{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom, my name is Nisha. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hello Nisha, main Karan Wilson hoon. Mera network coverage area mein bahut kharab hai, I am very frustrated with this service!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am truly sorry to hear that you are facing these network issues, Mr. Wilson. I understand how frustrating it is when your connection is unstable.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Haan, it's just not working. Isliye main apna connection cancel karna chahta hoon. I will switch to another provider because this is unacceptable.",
    "tags": ["churn_signal"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "We would hate to lose you as a customer. May I ask if there is any specific area where the signal is worst?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Mere ghar ke andar signal nahi aata. My phone number is 95462 38028, please just process the cancellation.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Just so you know, there is no early-termination fee for your current plan, and your final bill will arrive via email within the next seven business days.",
    "tags": ["disclosure"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Okay, that's fine. Bas jaldi se cancel kar do please.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I have now processed your cancellation request in our system, and you will receive a confirmation SMS shortly.",
    "tags": ["action:cancellation_or_retention"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Thank you, Nisha. Aapne bahut help ki, I am satisfied now.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "You are very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? Your account is now set for closure, and you will receive the final bill soon. Goodbye!",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
